  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC32_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Tell us about Novus. What is it like? Did you find Dasein? What of the splinters it fired into the Spiral?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Mole_Scholar_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Maulwurf_von_Trap_AR-PreNV_010.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1488197,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC32_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Yes, the splinters. We've been receiving reports from agents on many worlds - from Marleybone, Mirage, Polaris, Darkmoor, Karamelle and more...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Ione_Virga_AR-PreNV_001.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1488197,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC32_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "...Of strange rocks appearing in the sky. From what Maulwurf tells me, this was right around the time you saw Novus generate fragments of itself.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Ione_Virga_AR-PreNV_002.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1488197,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC32_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "We have to find out what these things are before everybody panics. Or everything is warped around them and we're all destroyed!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Celestian_Professor_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Qyburn_Stellargaze_AR-PreNV_012.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1488197,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC32_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Indeed, if this world can twist the laws of Magic, its influence is... worrying. We need you to reach one of these Novus Shards and gauge its effect.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Ione_Virga_AR-PreNV_003.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1488197,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC32_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Unfortunately, most of the worlds where Shards have appeared closed their ports. But Scholar Qismah has an idea I believe... has merit.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Ione_Virga_AR-PreNV_004.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1488197,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC32_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "If this world is your friend, you are the obvious choice to reach out to it. So we are promoting you to Executive Liaison. Now, speak to Qismah.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_StormTrainerF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Ione_Virga_AR-PreNV_005.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1488197,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC26_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I knew you would come. When the Stone of Heaven appeared in the skies, my people feared it an ill omen. I knew the Wizard would not be far behind.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cow_Emperor_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Emperor_Yoshihito_AR-PreNV_001.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1452125,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
